Let's verify the run of \url{https://github.com/dbosk/scholar/issues/166}:
fifty papers with the internal cap of [[-l 0]], then five with [[-l 5]].
The session keeps the wide record, every paper links to it, and the
report labels it with its total.  The other direction, a wider run
after a narrower one, replaces the narrow record as before; a failed
wide run does not displace a narrow answer; and the total survives a
save, while a record saved before it existed loads with the total
unknown.

