A record can also rebuild to another id than the one it is stored
under: the store keyed it by the hash id of a paper without a DOI, but
the record holds a DOI, or a URL from which an arXiv DOI is derived.
When the search returns the paper without a DOI, the two copies have
different ids and the DOI is on the stored side, the one case
[[stored_paper_with]] does not handle; the returned copy stands, with
the record's decision, as before
(\url{https://github.com/dbosk/scholarcli/issues/194}: the first fix
raised [[ValueError]] here).

