[[save_session]] reads the file just before writing.  When there is no
file there is nothing to merge; when the file cannot be read we cannot
merge either, and we say so, because the save is about to replace that
file (its unreadable content survives in the [[.bak]]).
The file is read without the paper registry
([[use_registry=False]]): through it, [[Paper.from_dict]] would hand us
the [[Paper]] objects this process already holds for the same ids, and
the file's copies, the other process's enrichment among them, would
never be seen.

